              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Inspire Series T5s</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">As T5, with a 15.6 in. touchscreen</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$3,199</td></tr>
