        <div id="where-to-buy" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">7. Where to Buy a Centr Treadmill</h2>
<p>
            Centr sells direct through its own US store, and its treadmills also turn up at several retailers.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Centr.</strong> The Runr at $1,299, Runr-S at $1,699 and Perform Tread at $6,999 on
            5 November 2026. Each includes the Centr app.</li>
            <li><strong>Costco.</strong> Sells Centr equipment as "Centr by Inspire Fitness", including the
